    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egebeti ifananywa nu musaala gwu mudaragwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lidiku liu kutanga, ku mweli gwa kavaga mu muhiga gwi likomi na mulala gwi lihaminywa lietu, Yahova yamoloma ninzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yambolera, “Mwana wu Mundu, ovoolere Mwami wa, Egebeti harara na vandu veve vosi ndi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kulwayago, Inzi Yahova Wuvunyali, ndaamuvolera aga ziza kwekoleka ku musaala yigu, ugwavirukaa kali kuduuka mu malesi. Lwa gwaviruka nigutambiha, gwaali ni liegingira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mali kukusuura kandi ndaleka umwamihi mugeni wu kutihiza ligali agokolere agadukanaa nagwo kandi kolondekana nu vudamanu vwagwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avageni vi zihiiri vukutihiza valagotema kandi valagoleka. Zisia ziagwo kandi amatu gagwo galavunguluka ku vuli kiguru kandi livona mu kivala. Zihiiri ziosi iziamenyaa mu chiriri chagwo zilagoleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amanyonyi galamenya ku musaala gumali kugwa yigu, kandi zinyama ziu mu vulimu ziladuvagira hasi zisia na amatu gagwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa, kutura kalunu, si gulavaho musaala gwosi, kali gove nigwasamwa vulahi ligali, guliviruka kandi gutambiha ligali kuli musaala yigu mba. Anoho zisia ziagwo sizilakaviruki kuduuka mu malesi kuli yigu mba. Josi jilakakuzi kuli avandu vakuza ma vazia mu kivala cha vakuzu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaga nigo aga Yahova Wuvunyali avoora, “Ku lidiku liene yilio lwu musaala yigu gulikuza nukuzia mu kivala chavakuzu, ndakagukuniki na mazi gu mu lirova, kuli kelolero chi Lisioma. Ndakagumili mazi gimigera gavuli kwituruka. Kigira musaala yigu gumali kukuza, ndakakuniki vigulu via Lebanoni ni kisundi, kandi ndakakole misaala josi ju mumulitu kwuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwu musaala yigu gulakakuzi nukuzia mu kivala cha vakuzu, lihulirika lie liigwa liagwo lilakadegerizi zihiiri. Misaala josi ja Edeni kandi misaala josi mitovole kandi milahi ja Lebanoni, ijasamwa mazi vulahi, ijiveeye hasi ku lirova, jilakasangaliri liigwa liu musaala yigu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josi jilakazie harara nagwo mukivala chavakuzu kuva harara ni jamala kugwa. Vosi avamenyaa isi wi chiriri chagwo valasalanywa hagati hi zihiiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Musaala yigu goveeye kuli mwami wa Egebeti harara na vandu veve vosi. Si jiveeye ho misaala mu Edeni jiveeye mitambi kandi jukuyaanziza mba. Navuzwa kalunu, alazia mu kivala cha vakuzu kuli misaala ja Edeni. Alakahambane harara na yavo avataveeye avasuuvirifu kandi yavo aviitirwa mu vulwani. Inzi Yahova Wuvunyali mali kovora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
